WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.925 --> 00:00:11.136
In the Indian Ocean

00:00:11.136 --> 00:00:14.097
another mom said time her journey

00:00:14.097 --> 00:00:15.765
to perfection.

00:00:22.897 --> 00:00:25.525
On a tiny speck of land

00:00:25.525 --> 00:00:28.403
Monsoon rains trigger

00:00:29.112 --> 00:00:32.741
a miracle of nature.

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:50.717
She may not look that impressive,
but this little Christmas Island

00:00:50.717 --> 00:00:53.428
red crab around the size of your hand

00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:57.515
is on a mission to become

00:00:57.515 --> 00:00:59.934
a mom.

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:07.025
Crabs evolved in the sea.

00:01:07.817 --> 00:01:10.195
But she's completely adapted to a life

00:01:10.695 --> 00:01:14.407
on land,

00:01:14.407 --> 00:01:18.703
almost.

00:01:18.703 --> 00:01:24.125
Her babies will only develop in saltwater.

00:01:24.793 --> 00:01:28.713
But to get there, a five mile

00:01:28.713 --> 00:01:34.344
trek from her home in the forest,

00:01:34.344 --> 00:01:37.180
all the way down

00:01:37.931 --> 00:01:40.433
to the beach.

00:01:42.936 --> 00:01:45.480
It's a long way on four inch legs,

00:01:46.898 --> 00:01:50.110
especially walking sideways.

00:01:52.695 --> 00:01:55.949
At least she's got company.

00:01:58.993 --> 00:02:01.037
70 million moms and dads

00:02:01.037 --> 00:02:04.415
to be called back to the ocean once a year

00:02:04.833 --> 00:02:06.126
to breed.

00:02:21.766 --> 00:02:23.059
This big

00:02:23.059 --> 00:02:27.063
little journey can take two weeks.

00:02:28.356 --> 00:02:30.441
And on the way,

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:39.450
there will be casualties.

00:02:44.581 --> 00:02:49.627
Ten times her size, the largest land

00:02:49.627 --> 00:02:52.213
crab on earth.

00:02:54.299 --> 00:02:56.259
Robber crab.

00:02:57.135 --> 00:03:01.598
Armed with crustacean crushing pincers.

00:03:04.434 --> 00:03:05.435
The red crabs

00:03:05.435 --> 00:03:08.438
eyesight is so bad that it's easy

00:03:09.647 --> 00:03:11.816
to run into trouble,

00:03:14.861 --> 00:03:16.863
and harder to get out

00:03:16.863 --> 00:03:19.032
alive.

00:03:22.827 --> 00:03:26.831
Unless luck is on your side.

00:03:30.251 --> 00:03:32.253
But there are bigger dangers

00:03:32.253 --> 00:03:33.796
still to face.

00:03:52.482 --> 00:03:55.068
She's got time this,

00:03:55.360 --> 00:03:57.737
just right.

00:04:21.886 --> 00:04:25.098
Fortunately, on lots of roads here today,

00:04:26.683 --> 00:04:30.103
the crabs get the right of way.

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:37.026
A million strong march

00:04:37.026 --> 00:04:38.861
all arrive

00:04:39.487 --> 00:04:43.324
right on schedule at the beach.

